### ==============================================================================
### AUTENTICACIÓN ADMIN (Ejecutar login para propagar el token a las otras peticiones)
### ==============================================================================

# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreUsuario": "admin",
  "contraseña": "admin123"
}

### VARIABLES AUTOMÁTICAS
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
@idProveedor = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.usuario.id}}
@id = 1

### CRUD DE AERONAVES

### GET ALL
GET http://localhost:3000/api/aeronaves

### GET ALL con filtros (modelo, fabricante, capacidadMin, capacidadMax, proveedor)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/aeronaves?modelo=Cessna&fabricante=Cessna&capacidadMin=2&capacidadMax=6

### MIS AERONAVES (proveedor logueado)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/aeronaves/mis-aeronaves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### MIS AERONAVES con filtros (proveedor logueado)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/aeronaves/mis-aeronaves?fabricante=Cessna
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SAVE
POST http://localhost:3000/api/aeronaves
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "Cessna 172 Skyhawk",
  "fabricante": "raro",
  "descripcion": "Aeronave monomotor de ala alta",
  "capacidad": 4,
  "autonomia": 1185,
  "velocidadMaxima": 226,
  "antiguedad": "2018-05-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "ultimoAeropuerto": 1,
  "proveedor": {{idProveedor}}
}

### GET BY PROVEEDOR
GET http://localhost:3000/api/aeronaves/proveedor/{{idProveedor}}

### GET ONE (Público)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/aeronaves/{{id}}

### UPDATE (Requiere Token de Proveedor o Admin)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/aeronaves/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descripcion": "Descripción actualizada",
  "velocidadMaxima": 230
}

### DELETE (Requiere Token de Proveedor o Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/aeronaves/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}